  "title": "Old-Fashioned Prune Cake",
  "description": "This prune cake is incredibly moist, warmly spiced, and finished with a buttery buttermilk glaze for a nostalgic dessert that’s perfect for holidays.",
  "authors": [
    "Wyjac"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-07-27T16:28:42-04:00",
